'''Prayer Re-Ordering'''

[[File:Game Improvements Poll Blog (22).png|center|70px]]


This feature would allow players to customise the order in which Prayers appear in the Prayer tab. It was polled previously, failing at just under 75%. Due to recent demand, we'd like to offer this once again.

{{News Poll|32|Should players be able to re-arrange the order in which Prayers appear in the Prayer tab? Doing so would not affect the icon size.}}


'''Re-Obtainable Quest Items'''

[[File:Game Improvements Poll Blog (23).png|center|100px]]


Some items may only be received during their related quests. Occasionally, there will be no way to recover them if they are destroyed, so we'd like to poll options for re-obtaining them in the two instances below. If there are other items that you would like the chance to re-obtain, we're open to suggestions.

{{News Poll|33|Should players be able to receive a new Blurite Sword by giving Thurgo a blurite ore and 2 iron bars after completion of The Knight's Sword quest?}}
{{News Poll|34|Should players be able to receive a new Dark Dagger from Radimus Erkle after completing Legends' Quest?}}


